{
 "android-forms|Search bar": {
  "summary": "A Plenix search bar on Android is the Material 3 search bar, kept native in behavior (it expands into the search view, with ripple, TalkBack semantics, the Search key on the keyboard and font scaling) and styled with the Plenix tokens: a 56 dp field with the 6 dp control radius, a 1 dp control border on the neutral fill, a DM Sans query in the body role and Plenix muted icons. Material’s default is a fully rounded bar in the surface container color with a tonal shadow; Plenix keeps Material’s structure and replaces the look.",
